der-radius:9px;padding:12px 13px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:14px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8D9C;margin-bottom:6px\">Access phrase<\/div>\n<input type=\"password\" value=\"{{ adminPass }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ onAdminPass }}\" placeholder=\"••••••••\" style=\"width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 13px;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onAdminLogin }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#0C2647;color:#FFFFFF;border:2px solid #0C2647;border-radius:10px;padding:15px;font-weight:900;font-size:14px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;margin-top:16px\">Enter studio<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onBackToGate }}\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;text-align:center;margin-top:18px;background:none;border:none;font-size:11.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9DAAB8;cursor:pointer;padding:8px\">← Leader sign-in<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n\n<sc-if value=\"{{ showHome }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"animation:jjIn .3s ease both\">\n<sc-if value=\"{{ needsBaseline }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<section style=\"margin:14px 12px 0;background:linear-gradient(150deg,#123663,#0C2647 62%,#0A1F3A);border-radius:18px;padding:24px 18px 20px;color:#FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FC0EA\">Step one<\/div>\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:26px;line-height:1.02;margin:9px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase\">Score your baseline<br>before you begin<\/h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#d5e2f0;margin:12px 0 0\">The Playbook Signature Assessment takes about five minutes. Ten lines, 1–10, a total out of 100. Everything you do from here is measured against this number — so the playbook opens once it is in.<\/p>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onStartAssess }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#FADA01;color:#0C2647;border:2px solid #FADA01;border-radius:10px;padding:15px;font-weight:900;font-size:13.5px;letter-spacing:.04em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;margin-top:18px\">Take the assessment →<\/button>\n<\/section>\n<section style=\"margin:12px 12px 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-radius:16px;padding:17px 16px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0C1B2E;margin-bottom:9px\">Why first<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#37475C;margin:0\">Without a starting number, a score three months from now means nothing. With one, every point is evidence. It also tells you which of the nine to work on first, instead of guessing.<\/p>\n<\/section>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasBaselineDone }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasValues }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onOpenValues }}\" style=\"display:block;width:calc(100% - 24px);margin:14px 12px 0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-radius:14px;padding:0;cursor:pointer;text-align:left;overflow:hidden\">\n<span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;padding:14px 15px\">\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasValuesLogo }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<img src=\"{{ valuesLogo }}\" alt=\"\" style=\"flex:none;height:30px;width:auto;max-width:104px;object-fit:contain\">\n<\/sc-if>\n<span style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-weight:900;font-size:20px;line-height:1;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.01em;color:#0C1B2E\">Our values<\/span>\n<\/span>\n<span style=\"flex:none;color:#0C1B2E;font-weight:900;font-size:18px\">→<\/span>\n<\/span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;padding:0 15px 14px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{ valueChips }}\" as=\"vch\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<span style=\"{{ vch.style }}\">{{ vch.name }}<\/span>\n<\/sc-for>\n<\/span>\n<span style=\"display:flex;height:5px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{ valueChips }}\" as=\"vcb\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<i style=\"{{ vcb.barStyle }}\"><\/i>\n<\/sc-for>\n<\/span>\n<\/button>\n<\/sc-if>\n\n<section style=\"{{ heroStyle }}\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px\">\n<div style=\"min-width:0\">\n<div style=\"{{ brandKickerStyle }}\">{{ orgName }}<\/div>\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:22px;line-height:1;margin:6px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.01em\">Playbook Overview<\/h1>\n<div style=\"font-size:11.5px;color:#A9BDD6;margin-top:4px\">{{ programSubtitle }}<\/div>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ showStreakPill }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onOpenStreak }}\" style=\"{{ streakPillStyle }}\"><span style=\"{{ streakPillFlameStyle }}\">🔥<\/span>{{ streakPillCount }}<\/button>\n<\/sc-if>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:6px;flex:none\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onOpenScore }}\" style=\"{{ heroScoreStyle }}\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF\">{{ heroScoreValue }}<\/span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9BDD6;margin-top:2px\">{{ heroScoreCaption }}<\/span>\n<\/button>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasPeerLink }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ onOpenPeer }}\" style=\"{{ heroPeerStyle }}\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-weight:900;font-size:17px;line-height:1;color:#FFFFFF\">{{ heroPeerValue }}<\/span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:7.5px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A9BDD6;margin-top:2px\">Peer<\/span>\n<\/button>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ hasTeamRing }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<button sc-camel-