00;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FC0EA\">Sent<\/div>\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:26px;line-height:1.02;text-transform:uppercase;margin:9px 0 0\">Thank you — that<br>is all we needed<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#d5e2f0;margin:12px 0 0\">Your answers were sent anonymously. Nobody sees a single response on its own — only averages, and only once enough people have replied. You can close this page.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n\n<sc-if value=\"{{ pf.valid }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div>\n<div style=\"background:#0C2647;border-radius:18px;padding:24px 18px 22px;color:#FFFFFF\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6FC0EA\">{{ pf.org }}<\/div>\n<h1 style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:26px;line-height:1.02;margin:9px 0 0;text-transform:uppercase\">{{ pf.title }}<\/h1>\n<p style=\"font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#d5e2f0;margin:12px 0 0\">Ten statements about the team you are part of, scored 1–10. About three minutes. There is no sign-in and no name attached — your answers are pooled with everyone else's and only ever read as an average.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;background:#FFF8D6;border:1px solid #D4B400;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 14px;margin:12px 0 4px\">\n<span style=\"flex:none;font-size:17px\">🔒<\/span>\n<span style=\"font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#6b5410\">Answer honestly. Nothing here is traced back to you, and nothing is shown at all until at least three people have replied.<\/span>\n<\/div>\n\n<sc-for list=\"{{ pf.rows }}\" as=\"pq\" hint-placeholder-count=\"10\">\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-left:4px solid {{ pq.edge }};border-radius:13px;padding:15px 15px 13px;margin-top:12px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8D9C\">{{ pq.label }}<\/span>\n<span style=\"{{ pq.pickedStyle }}\">{{ pq.picked }}<\/span>\n<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#0C1B2E;margin:7px 0 12px\">{{ pq.stmt }}<\/p>\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:5px\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{ pq.options }}\" as=\"po\" hint-placeholder-count=\"9\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ po.onPick }}\" style=\"{{ po.style }}\">{{ po.n }}<\/button>\n<\/sc-for>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-for>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-left:4px solid #FADA01;border-radius:13px;padding:15px 15px 13px;margin-top:12px\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#0C1B2E;margin:0 0 9px\">{{ pf.q1 }}<\/p>\n<textarea value=\"{{ pf.keep }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ pf.onKeep }}\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"{{ pf.ph1 }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#F3F7FB;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;font-family:inherit;color:#0C1B2E;line-height:1.55;resize:vertical\"><\/textarea>\n<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-left:4px solid #FADA01;border-radius:13px;padding:15px 15px 13px;margin-top:12px\">\n<p style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:14px;line-height:1.45;color:#0C1B2E;margin:0 0 9px\">{{ pf.q2 }}<\/p>\n<textarea value=\"{{ pf.change }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ pf.onChangeText }}\" rows=\"3\" placeholder=\"{{ pf.ph2 }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#F3F7FB;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 12px;font-size:14px;font-weight:500;font-family:inherit;color:#0C1B2E;line-height:1.55;resize:vertical\"><\/textarea>\n<\/div>\n\n<div style=\"position:sticky;bottom:10px;padding:14px 0 20px;background:linear-gradient(transparent,#F3F7FB 45%)\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ pf.onSubmit }}\" style=\"{{ pf.submitStyle }}\">{{ pf.submitLabel }}<\/button>\n<p style=\"text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:#7E8D9C;margin:9px 0 0\">{{