ax-width:44ch\">Start it from the Y1 format and you get the same nine fundamentals in the same order, with the lessons emptied out for you to write. Nothing publishes until you press Publish.<\/p>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ admin.onSeedEdition }}\" style=\"background:#0C2647;color:#FFFFFF;border:none;border-radius:9px;padding:13px 18px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:900;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer\">Start Y2 from the Y1 format<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ admin.canImportY1 }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"background:#fff;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-left:5px solid #00A3E0;border-radius:0 12px 12px 0;padding:14px 15px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:14px;color:#0C1B2E\">{{ admin.importY1Label }}<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#37475C;margin:7px 0 11px\">{{ admin.importY1Note }}<\/p>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ admin.onImportY1 }}\" style=\"background:#00A3E0;color:#FFFFFF;border:none;border-radius:9px;padding:12px 16px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:900;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.07em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer\">Load it in<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ admin.editionSeeded }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8D9C;margin-bottom:6px\">Editing content for<\/div>\n<sc-raw-select value=\"{{ admin.contentOrgValue }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ admin.onContentOrg }}\" style=\"{{ admin.inputStyle }}\">\n<sc-for list=\"{{ admin.contentOrgOptions }}\" as=\"co\" hint-placeholder-count=\"4\">\n<option value=\"{{ co.value }}\">{{ co.label }}<\/option>\n<\/sc-for>\n<\/sc-raw-select>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ admin.contentIsMaster }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<p style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#7E8D9C;line-height:1.6;margin:12px 0 14px\">Edits here publish to <b>{{ admin.editionName }}<\/b> — read by every organization assigned to it. The other edition is untouched.<\/p>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ admin.contentIsOrg }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"background:#FFF8D6;border:1px solid #8a7420;border-radius:10px;padding:11px 13px;margin:12px 0 14px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6b5410\">Organization-only edits<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:#6b5410;line-height:1.55;margin:5px 0 0\">Changes below apply to <b>{{ admin.contentOrgName }}<\/b> and nobody else. Anything you leave alone keeps following the master playbook — including future updates to it.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ admin.contentIsMaster }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ admin.onAddFundamental }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#0C2647;color:#FFFFFF;border:none;border-radius:10px;padding:13px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:900;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:12px\">Add a fundamental<\/button>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-for list=\"{{ admin.modules }}\" as=\"m\" hint-placeholder-count=\"9\">\n<div style=\"{{ m.cardStyle }}\" draggable=\"{{ m.draggable }}\" sc-camel-on-drag-start=\"{{ m.onDragStart }}\" sc-camel-on-drag-over=\"{{ m.onDragOver }}\" sc-camel-on-drop=\"{{ m.onDrop }}\" sc-camel-on-drag-end=\"{{ m.onDragEnd }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ m.onToggle }}\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;width:100%;text-align:left;background:transparent;border:none;padding:13px 14px;cursor:pointer\">\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.draggable }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<span style=\"flex:none;color:#9DAAB8;font-size:15px;line-height:1;cursor:grab\" title=\"Drag to move\">⠿<\/span>\n<\/sc-if>\n<img src=\"{{ m.icon }}\" alt=\"\" style=\"{{ m.listIconStyle }}\">\n<span style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n<span style=\"display:block;font-weight:800;font-size:14.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0C1B2E\">{{ m.name }}<\/span>\n<span style=\"display:block;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9DAAB8;margin-top:2px\">{{ m.levelLabel }}<\/span>\n<\/span>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.isOverridden }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<span style=\"flex:none;font-weight:900;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;background:#FADA01;color:#0C2647;padding:3px 7px;border-radius:4px\">Custom<\/span>\n<\/sc-if>\n<span style=\"font-size:15px;color:#7E8D9C\">{{ m.caret }}<\/span>\n<\/button>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.open }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"padding:0 14px 16px;border-top:1px solid #DCE6F0\">\n<div style=\"border-bottom:2px solid #DCE6F0;margin-top:14px;padding-bottom:14px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0C1B2E\">Fundamental overview<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7E8D9C;line-height:1.55;margin:5px 0 9px\">Shown at the top of this fundamental's page, right under the title.<\/p>\n<textarea value=\"{{ m.overview }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ m.onOverview }}\" placeholder=\"What this fundamental is, and why it matters.\" style=\"width:100%;min-height:110px;resize:vertical;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.6;font-family:inherit\"><\/textarea>\n<\/div>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.isOverridden }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ m.onReset }}\" style=\"width:100%;margin-top:13px;background:transparent;color:#7E8D9C;border:1.5px solid #DCE6F0;border-radius:8px;padding:9px;font-weight:800;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer\">Reset this fundamental to master<\/button>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.activitiesEditable }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div style=\"border-top:2px solid #DCE6F0;margin-top:16px;padding-top:14px\">\n<div style=\"font-weight:900;font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#0C1B2E\">Toolkit activities<\/div>\n<p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#7E8D9C;line-height:1.55;margin:5px 0 12px\">These are what leaders see inside this fundamental's folder in My Toolkit.<\/p>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.noActivities }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"background:#F3F7FB;border:1px dashed #C6D4E2;border-radius:10px;padding:13px;font-size:12.5px;color:#7E8D9C;margin-bottom:10px\">No activities yet. Add the first one below.<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-for list=\"{{ m.activities }}\" as=\"ma\" hint-placeholder-count=\"2\">\n<div style=\"background:#F3F7FB;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:7px\">\n<span style=\"font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8D9C\">{{ ma.label }}<\/span>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ ma.onDelete }}\" style=\"background:none;border:none;padding:0;font-family:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D5502B;cursor:pointer\">Delete<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"{{ ma.title }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ ma.onTitle }}\" placeholder=\"Activity name\" style=\"width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px\">\n<textarea value=\"{{ ma.desc }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ ma.onDesc }}\" placeholder=\"What they do, in a few lines.\" style=\"width:100%;min-height:70px;resize:vertical;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:8px;padding:10px 12px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.55;font-family:inherit\"><\/textarea>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-for>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ m.onAddActivity }}\" style=\"width:100%;background:#0C2647;color:#FFFFFF;border:none;border-radius:9px;padding:12px;font-weight:800;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;cursor:pointer\">+ Add activity<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.activitiesLocked }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ false }}\">\n<div style=\"background:#F3F7FB;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-top:16px;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#37475C\">Toolkit activities are edited on the master program — switch the selector above to Master to change them.<\/div>\n<\/sc-if>\n<sc-if value=\"{{ m.placeEditable }}\" hint-placeholder-val=\"{{ true }}\">\n<div style=\"background:#F3F7FB;border:1px solid #DCE6F0;border-radius:11px;padding:12px;margin-bottom:14px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;margin-bottom:9px\">\n<span style=\"flex:1;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#7E8D9C\">Placement<\/span>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ m.onDuplicateFund }}\" style=\"flex:none;background:none;border:none;padding:0 2px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#184E86;cursor:pointer\">Duplicate<\/button>\n<button sc-camel-on-click=\"{{ m.onRemoveFund }}\" style=\"flex:none;background:none;border:none;padding:0 2px;font-family:inherit;font-weight:800;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.09em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#D5502B;cursor:pointer\">Remove<\/button>\n<\/div>\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"{{ m.nameVal }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ m.onName }}\" placeholder=\"Fundamental name\" style=\"width:100%;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 11px;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:7px\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;gap:7px;margin-bottom:7px\">\n<sc-raw-select value=\"{{ m.tierVal }}\" sc-camel-on-change=\"{{ m.onTier }}\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0;background:#fff;border:1px solid #C6D4E2;border-radius:8px;padding:9px 10px;font-size:13px;font-family:inherit;color:#0C1B2E\">\n